2. Her delayed onset Crystallize effects can ensure all the control she applies will take full effects on her enemies;
3. Her skill "Mighty Prayer" will almost definitely control the targets of her basic attacks if they don't have high immunity attributes.
4. Krystal can also heal herself and increase her own Attack even Poison the targets when they got Crystallized. Which makes Krystal very strong in the battles that lasts longer.

853013.desc:
1. A deadly damage dealer in House Monster;
2. Her Basic Attack targets the enemy with the lowest Hp;
3. Her skills Bleed her enemies and tags Disintegration marks on them. Which allows her to deal great amount of damage without receiving any support from her team while supporting her allies to deal more damage.

852014.desc:
1. A damage dealer with decent survival ability in House Human;
2. Rogue's Active skill targets the enemy with the highest HP with the help of her skill "Additional Chips" and "Royal Flush" she's able to threaten all her enemies
3. Rogue is able to attach "Dauntless" status to reflect the damages she takes and "Disrespect" status to immune from control skills to herself rapidly.

skills.desc:
Rogue's Active skill targets the enemy with the highest HP and Burn her;
This skill has a very high damage ratio when Rogue reaches 10-star and the Burn status it attaches to the target makes Rogue a possible choice for a team needs more Burn Dot damage;
Rogue can get "Disrespect" status by triggering this skill to gain resistance against control skills.

851013.desc:
1. A supporter in House Ghost;
2. Vivian is able to Heal and remove Debuffs for her allies she's also able to remove Buffs from her enemies and attach Debuffs to them;
3. With the help of her "Galaxy" Vivian would be able to support the team a lot as she lasts longer in the battlefield.

