854016.desc:
1. A supporter in House Fairy;
2. Kassy's Active Skills and Basic Attacks will Crit when her targets have low HP she can also deal additional damage to her enemies and heal herself according to the total damage dealt;
3. Kassy can provide her allies "Cat Eyes" after triggering her Active skills to grant them the ability to deal additional damage and heal from the total damage dealt as well;
4. Kassy will provide a buff for the entire team at the start of the battle and at the end of each round. The Girls from Assassin Class will gain double the benefit from the buff. The buff provided by Kassy(s) can be stacked.

skills.desc:
Kassy's Active skill hits the enemy with lowest HP twice if the enemy has lower than 50% HP the 2 hits will trigger Crit;
The skill will also deal additional damage according to the lost HP of the target and heal Kassy according to the total damage dealt (2 hits + additional damage);
Kassy can also provide "Cat Eyes" to her allies by triggering this skill granting them the ability to deal additional damage and heal from the total damage dealt as well.

852017.desc:
1. A supporter in House Human.
2. Monica can greatly increase the survival ability and offensive ability of her allies (Remember: Monica will support the ally whose position is right behind herself first);
3. Monica can also provide protection when her allies take lethal damage enabling the ally to ignore the lethal damage and all other damage taken in this round. (But this skill can be triggered on each ally only once in a battle.)

